# Product (always)

- **Jabalpur-only** city platform. No multi-city generic template.
- **Bilingual HI/EN** from day one. Greeting **"नर्मदे हर / Narmade Har"** with an on/off toggle; never use the greeting on accident, disorder, or bereavement copy.
- Brand colors only from `site/src/styles/tokens.css`: marble-white, river-teal, diya-saffron (+ ink/muted).

## Cost and vendors (R1–R2)

- ₹0 recurring infra. **No credit card** on any service.
- Allowed: Cloudflare Pages/Workers/R2, Supabase free, MapLibre + OpenFreeMap, UPI deep links.
- Forbidden: Google Maps Platform API, Vercel Hobby, paid LLMs as source of truth, SMS OTP, Apple sign-in, scraping social platforms.

## Secrets and accounts

- Never commit `.env`, `.env.*`, `.env.example`, `*.pem`, `*.key`, `service_role`, or API tokens.
- Supabase project for this app: **`dsjmjxrnqedypuolguow` only**. Never migrate against the CRM project.
- This folder’s git identity stays **`iampr333`**.

## Deploy

```bash
npm run build
npx wrangler deploy -c site/wrangler.jsonc
# or: npm run pages:deploy
```

Never run bare `npx wrangler deploy` from the monorepo root (workspace error).

## Scope

Ship by BRD phase. Do not start AI, AR, native apps, star ratings, or business portals in P0–P1.
